  CoursesApp -->|downloads recipe PDFs, with URLs presigned by recipes-api, from| Media
  Viewer -->|looks up menus and records views through| Api
  Composer -->|sends newsletters with recipe links to| Reader
  Picker -->|signs in through| Sso
  Reader -->|opens recipe links on| Viewer
  Viewer -->|streams previews from, and presigns photos and PDFs of| Media
  EditorApp -->|signs in through| Sso
  Editor -->|uploads and publishes recipes in| EditorApp
  Composer -->|embeds the picker of| Picker
  CoursesApi -->|lists published recipes and gets presigned PDF URLs from| Api
  EditorApp -->|forwards uploads, publishing and view queries to| Api
  Picker -->|lists published recipes and creates menus through| Api
  Marketer -->|copies recipe links from| Picker
  Api -->|sends menu-created, view and download events to| Analytics
  Api ==>|reads and writes drafts, recipes and menu snapshots in| Media
  Api ==>|reads and writes recipes, menus and view events in| Db
  Marketer -->|writes newsletters in| Composer
  CoursesApp -->|reads and edits courses, enrollments and progress through| CoursesApi
